                <pb facs="0141" n="13" sameAs="frus:frus1885/pg13"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure 11 in No. 53—Translation of
                        telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mother of Feinknopf to Mr.
                            Francis</hi>.</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Krakau</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1885-01-12"><hi rendition="#italic">January</hi> 12,
                        1885</date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Up to this hour my son has not been furloughed.</p>
                <closer><signed>FEINKNOPF.</signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
